From 68e93cf7811256a13b46481a1c962a53e752af65 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: suvojeet-sengupta <suvojitsengupta21@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 07:27:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: Add a sound mode tile

Add a Sound tile that moves the ringer from ring to vibrate to silent
on each tap, like the volume panel's ringer button, shows the mode
with its icon, and opens the sound settings on a long press. It's in
the tile list as sound.

Change-Id: I467504b010fc2a9c721b1fa5e388a9b59f1cb8d9
